title: FirstLoopWisteriaTree1
---
-> “Hello.”
-> “Do you know where Dmitriy Yildiz is?”
<< if $FirstLoopWisteriaOptionsPicked == 0 >>
She stares at you, as if it had been her that just spoke rather than you. 
There is not even an attempt at a reply.
<< set $FirstLoopWisteriaOptionsPicked = 1 >>
<< jump FirstLoopWisteriaTree1 >>
<< else >>
Wisteria: “Are you hurt, wounded, or dying?”
-> “...No?”
-> “Not physically.”
Wisteria: “Then we have nothing to talk about.”
Wisteria: “You can leave now.”
She says that both as if she is granting permission to, as well as a demand.
You won’t get any kinder words from her than this. Perhaps you can come back to her sometime if you have something that you specifically need from her.
<< endif >>

